---
import Horizon from '../Horizon.astro';

const points = [
  'A case manager assigned from early in your stay',
  'They ask what you want to do, rather than telling you',
  'Appointments arranged before you leave, not after',
  'Getting home is planned too, not left to the last day',
];
---
<section id="hero" class="bg-cream">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-[60px] lg:py-[80px]">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_minmax(0,470px)] gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-gold font-body text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase mb-5 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-6 h-px bg-gold inline-block"></span>
          After treatment · Chandler, Arizona
        </p>

        <h1 class="font-display text-navy mb-6">
          The month is not the hard part. The month after is.
        </h1>

        <p class="font-body text-charcoal text-[20px] leading-[33px] max-w-xl mb-8">
          Almost everyone does well in a building where the day has a shape and somebody is checking on them. What decides how this goes is the fortnight after you walk out — and that is worked on from early in your stay rather than on the morning you leave.
        </p>

        <ul class="space-y-3 mb-9">
          {points.map(item => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-charcoal text-[17px] leading-[29px]">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-teal mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/>
              </svg>
              {item}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>

        <div class="border-l-2 border-gold pl-5 mb-9 max-w-xl">
          <p class="font-body text-charcoal text-[16px] leading-[26px]">
            <strong class="font-bold">If you are choosing between programmes, ask each of them this.</strong> Not what their success rate is — nobody can substantiate that — but who plans your discharge, when they start, and what is actually booked before you leave. The answers vary far more than the brochures do.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
          <a href="tel:8883625576" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-teal hover:bg-teal-dark text-white font-semibold h-14 px-8 rounded-lg transition-colors font-body">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
              <path d="M2 3a1 1 0 011-1h2.153a1 1 0 01.986.836l.74 4.435a1 1 0 01-.54 1.06l-1.548.773a11.037 11.037 0 006.105 6.105l.774-1.548a1 1 0 011.059-.54l4.435.74a1 1 0 01.836.986V17a1 1 0 01-1 1h-2C7.82 18 2 12.18 2 5V3z"/>
            </svg>
            Ask us how discharge works
          </a>
          <a href="/resources/sober-living-arizona/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center border-2 border-navy text-navy hover:bg-navy hover:text-white font-semibold h-14 px-8 rounded-lg transition-colors font-body">
            Somewhere to live after
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-t-[160px] rounded-b-xl shadow-xl">
          <img
            src="/Asset/stock%20photo/Desktop%20Dimensions/Facility/Open%20multipurpose%20hall%20with%20patterned%20flooring,%20gallery%20walls,%20and%20wide%20circulation%20space.png"
            alt="An open multipurpose hall with gallery walls and wide circulation space"
            class="w-full object-cover aspect-[4/5]"
            fetchpriority="high"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>
        <Horizon variant="rule" class="mt-5" />
        <p class="font-body text-muted text-[15px] leading-[24px] mt-3">
          The door you walk out of, with a plan attached.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
